     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;line-height:normal;outline:0px;font-size:14px;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;color:rgb(133,133,133);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;\">Learn how to use Big Data Analytics from beginner level to advanced techniques which are taught by experienced working professionals. With our Big Data Analytics Training in Chennai and bangalore, you’ll learn concepts in expert level with practical manner.</p><h3 style=\"padding-bottom:2px;font-size:1.5em;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(51,51,51);outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;\">What Is Big Data?</h3><div style=\"outline:0px;font-size:14px;vertical-align:baseline;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;color:rgb(133,133,133);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;\"><div style=\"outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><p style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;line-height:normal;outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Big data refers to the large and complex set of data that are difficult to process using traditional processing systems. Stock exchanges like NYSE and BSE generate Terabytes of data every day. Social media sites like Facebook generates data that are approximately 500 times bigger than stock exchanges.</p><p style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;line-height:normal;outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">Hadoop is an open source project by Apache used for storage and processing of large volume of unstructured data in a distributed environment. Hadoop can scale up from a single server to thousands of servers.</p><p style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;line-height:normal;outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><a href=\"https://www.besanttechnologies.com/training-courses/data-warehousing-training/big-data-analytics-training-institute-in-chennai\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.besanttechnologies.com/training-courses/data-warehousing-training/big-data-analytics-training-institute-in-chennai&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443476919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-UQDZMkPl0pIylaq33eag\">Big data  training in chennai</a></p><p style=\"margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:5px;padding-top:5px;padding-bottom:5px;line-height:normal;outline:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><a href=\"https://www.besanttechnologies.com/training-courses/data-warehousing-training/big-data-hadoop-training-institute-in-bangalore\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.besanttechnologies.com/training-courses/data-warehousing-training/big-data-hadoop-training-institute-in-bangalore&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443476919000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hxY_5qVWnCciKOx01JnWP\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Big data </span> training in bangalore</a></p></div></div></div>"
